RUK RUK KE DEKHTE HAIN HASRAT SE LAASHE ASGHER,<br>
 MAQTAL SE JA RAHE HAIN KHAIME KI SIMT SARWAR<br>
<br>
SHIDDAT KI TISHNAGI MEIN SUN KAR SADA-E-HALMIN ,<br>
 JHOOLE SE AARAHE HAIN MAQTAL KI SIMT ASGHER<br>
<br>
TEERE SITAM KA LAGNA BESHEER KA MACHALNA,<br>
 KYA JAANE KAISE DEKHA SHABBIR NE YE MANZAR<br>
<br>
GHABRA KE RORAHE THE MUH PHAIR KAR SITAMGAR ,<br>
 ASGHER NE PHERI JISDAM SUKHI ZUBAAN LABOON PAR<br>
<br>
RUKTE HAIN SOONCHTE HAIN BANO KO KYA BATAYEN,<br>
 BECHAIN HO RAHE HAIN APNI ABA UDHA KAR<br>
<br>
AULAD WALA SHAYED KOI NAHIN THA INME ,<br>
 TEERE SITAM CHALAYA BESHEER KE GALLE PAR<br>
<br>
PAIHAM JHULA RAHI HAIN HASRAT SE KHAALI JHOOLA ,<br>
 SAMJHA-E-KAUN USKO KAISE JIYEGI MAADAR<br>
<br>
AB AYE SOHAIL THAM JA AUR ROK LE KHALAM KO,<br>
 DIL RO RAHEIN HAIN SUB KE NOUHA YE TERA SUNKAR..